8001 REM EDIT gds\gdslib.bas, THEN RUN node gds\sync_gdslib.mjs
8002 REM RESERVED: Q* ER H T ZR PP PW PL FL VD VP NS PM FW FE LY LP LT
8003 REM GV GU GM RF R1-R4 G1-G4 GW GP CX CY CR TX TY TS$ PX PY PO PN$
8004 REM RY LD DD PA$ PB$ W U DU DR TT HX U1 U2 Z1 Z2 ZA AA BB EA EE ZZ
